      *################################################################*00010000
      *                                                                 00020000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00030000
      *                                                                 00040000
      * Copy-area R115IMC0.                                             00050005
      *                                                                 00060000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Main_Contract.    00070005
      *                                                                 00080000
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00090000
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00100000
      * from- and to- values.                                           00110000
      *                                                                 00120000
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00130000
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00140000
      *                                                                 00150000
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00160002
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00170002
      *      See seperate description below.                            00180002
      *                                                                 00190002
      *                                                                 00200000
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00210001
      *                                                                 00220000
      *    Initialize                          R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00230005
      *    Set   R115IMC0-Version        To    True                     00240005
      *    Set   R115IMC0-In-Select      To    True                     00250005
      *                                                                 00260027
      * One of these:                                                   00270027
      * 1) Set   R115IMC0-In-Actual      To    True                     00280027
      * 2) Set   R115IMC0-In-Work        To    True                     00290027
      *                                                                 00300027
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00310005
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type00320007
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115IMC0-In-Contract-No  00330007
      *                                                                 00340000
      *    Call  'F115IMC0'              Using R115IMC0-Main-Contract   00350005
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00360017
      *    End-Call                                                     00370000
      *                                                                 00380000
      *    Evaluate True                                                00390000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00400017
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00410017
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00420000
      *                                                                 00430000
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00440018
      *        ...not found...                                          00450000
      *                                                                 00460000
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00470017
      *        ...found...                                              00480000
      *                                                                 00490000
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00500000
      *                                                                 00510000
      *################################################################*00520000
      * Date ! Si! Change description                            ! 3A ! 00530000
