      *090113!NDL! Added -Incom-Swift for Guarantiees            !    ! 00540145
      *030703!NDL! Added -Silent Confirmation                    !LY15! 00541039
      *230401!NDL! Added -Incom-Swift                            !LT12! 00542039
      *190600!HLR! Changed cursor-qual. on TFMC_Contr_Type       !LO18! 00550035
      *      !   ! from "Like" to "=".                           !    ! 00560032
      *      !   ! Removed -In-From-Contr-No.                    !    ! 00570034
      *      !   ! Removed -In-To-Contr-No.                      !    ! 00580034
      *150699!HLR! Added -In-Status                              !LG10! 00590030
      *310599!HLR! Added -Issued-Date & -Confirmed.              !LG10! 00600030
      *290499!HLR! Added -Upd-Timestamp.                         !LG10! 00610029
      *280499!HLR! New fields: Upd-User-ID, Upd-Date, Upd-Time   !LG10! 00620021
      *080399!HLR! Availability changed from X(12) to X(01)      !LG10! 00630020
      *290199!HLR! New copy area                                 !LG10! 00640013
      *################################################################*00650000
