         03  R115IMC0-Main-Contract.                                    00670005
      *                                                                 00680000
           05  R115IMC0-Version-No              Pic  X(08).             00690005
             88  R115IMC0-Version                    Value '20000619'.  00700034
      *                                                                 00710000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*00720000
      *                                                                 00730000
           05  R115IMC0-Qualification.                                  00740005
      *                                                                 00750000
             10  R115IMC0-In-Action             Pic  X(16).             00760005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Get-1st               Value 'GET-1ST'.   00770005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Get-Next              Value 'GET-NEXT'.  00780005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Select                Value 'SELECT'.    00790005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Insert                Value 'INSERT'.    00800005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Update                Value 'UPDATE'.    00810005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Delete                Value 'DELETE'.    00820005
               88  R115IMC0-In-Upd-Status            Value 'UPDSTA'.    00822042
               88  R115IMC0-In-Upd-TimeStamp         Value 'UPDTST'.    00823043
      *                                                                 00830000
      * In-Upd-Status updates both status and timestamp                 00831043
      *                                                                 00832043
      * There are several key-fields, which may be used differently     00840001
      * depending on the need.                                          00850001
      *                                                                 00860000
      * In-Table must be set whatever the desired action is.            00870027
      *                                                                 00880027
      * For Insert, use the Data area for all fields.                   00890023
      *                                                                 00900023
      * For Select, Update and Delete, use:                             00910023
      *     - Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                                00920001
      *     - Contract-Type                                             00930007
      *     - Contract-No                                               00940007
      *                                                                 00950001
      * For cursor (Get-1st / Get-Next), use:                           00960001
      *     - Optional: Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID                      00970001
      *     - Optional: Customer-No or Customer-ID                      00980001
      *                 (If used, Fin-Inst is mandatory)                00990033
      *     - Optional: Contract-Type                                   01000006
      *     - Optional: Contract-No                                     01010034
      *     - Optional: Status (only with Fin-Inst-No)                  01020030
      *                                                                 01030001
             10  R115IMC0-In-Key.                                       01040005
      *                                                                 01050001
               15  R115IMC0-In-Table-Version    Pic  X(16).             01060028
                 88  R115IMC0-In-Actual              Value 'ACTUAL'.    01070027
                 88  R115IMC0-In-Work                Value 'WORK'.      01080027
      *                                                                 01090027
      *        It is optional wether you use Fin-Inst-No or Fin-Inst-ID.01100001
               15  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst.                                01110005
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-No    Pic  X(18).             01120015
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Fin-Inst-ID    Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01130005
      *                                                                 01140001
      *        It is optional wether you use Customer-No or Customer-ID.01150001
      *        When using Customer-No, Fin-Inst is mandatory.           01160001
      *        Customer is only relevant for cursor (Get-1st/Get-Next)  01170001
               15  R115IMC0-In-Customer.                                01180005
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Customer-No    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01190005
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Customer-ID    Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01200005
      *                                                                 01210001
      *        Contract-Type and -No is mandatory for                   01220007
      *        Select/Update/Delete.                                    01230023
               15  R115IMC0-In-Contract.                                01240006
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Contract-Type  Pic  X(03).             01250007
                 20  R115IMC0-In-Contract-No    Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01260009
      *                                                                 01270007
      *        Status is optional for Get-1st / Get-Next.               01280030
               15  R115IMC0-In-Status           Pic  X(12).             01290030
      *                                                                 01300030
      * When performing a Get-1st-call one may ask for the total        01310000
      * number of rows complying with the qualification.                01320000
      *                                                                 01330000
             10  R115IMC0-In-Code-Count         Pic  X(10).             01340005
               88  R115IMC0-In-CC-Count              Value 'COUNT'.     01350005
      *                                                                 01360000
      *----------------------------------------------------------------*01370000
      *                                                                 01380000
           05  R115IMC0-Data.                                           01390005
