               15  R115IMC0-Fin-Inst-ID         Pic S9(18)       Comp-3.01420005
               15  R115IMC0-Customer-ID         Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01430005
               15  R115IMC0-Contract-ID.                                01440006
                 20  R115IMC0-Contract-Type     Pic  X(03).             01450009
                 20  R115IMC0-Contract-No       Pic S9(07)       Comp-3.01460009
