      *                                                                 01800029
      * The following accumulators are only relevant when performing    01810000
      * Get-1st or Get-Next.                                            01820000
      * Row-No starts on 1 when doing Get-1st, and increases by 1 for   01830000
      * each Get-Next.                                                  01840000
      * Total-Rows is set when doing Get-1st, but ONLY if the           01850000
      * In-CC-Count is set. The field will tell you how many rows       01860000
      * that complies with your qualification.                          01870000
      *                                                                 01880000
             10  R115IMC0-Out-Accumulators.                             01890005
               15  R115IMC0-Out-Row-No          Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01900005
               15  R115IMC0-Out-Total-Rows      Pic S9(11)       Comp-3.01910005
